{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/_iverogotiisai\u306e\u30b3\u30d2\u309a\u30fc.png?t=1743604947\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/\u6b69\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3053\u308d.gif?t=1743604947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-03-20_15.51.42.png?t=1743604947\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590010?t=1743604947","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3590010?t=1743604947","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743604947","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743604947","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/_iverogotiisai\u306e\u30b3\u30d2\u309a\u30fc.png?t=1743604947\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/\u6b69\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u3068\u3053\u308d.gif?t=1743604947\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/extras/\u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30fc\u30f3\u30b7\u30e7\u30c3\u30c8_2025-03-20_15.51.42.png?t=1743604947\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Estimated Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd52 <strong>1 to 2 hours</strong></p>","developers":["Buttercup garden"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3590010/c94acea102da6a641c9d96b019498e399627f200/header.jpg?t=1743604947","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"This software was created using RPG Maker MZ.<br />\r\n\u00a9Gotcha Gotcha Games Inc./YOJI OJIMA 2020","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":